From fe9119e97a48b9f6c2491f677a910c4030f7f97d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cong Nguyen <cong.nguyen.zn@renesas.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:07:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] board: renesas: rzv2h-dev: add RZ/V2H RDK ver101 board
 support

Add TARGET_RZV2H_RDK, rzv2h-rdk_defconfig and rzv2h-rdk-ver101.dts for
the RZ/V2H RDK ver101, a custom board derived from the RZ/V2H EVK ver1.

Differences from EVK ver1:
- DDR: 8GB Foresee LPDDR4X, 4GB per channel
  (0x0_4800_0000-0x1_3FFF_FFFF, 0x2_4000_0000-0x3_3FFF_FFFF).
- Ethernet: only CH0 PHY (KSZ9131). RESET_N is driven by P47 through
  a diode with a 10K/10uF RC pull-up, so board_late_init() pulses P47
  instead of toggling PMIC Buck5 (S1.2V only supplies the PHY core).
- P47 is PHY_RESET and RIIC6/RIIC7 are not on P44-P47, so do not mux
  them and drop i2c6/i2c7 (and CSI22/CSI23 cameras).
- SD1 not populated: PA2/PA3 are CAN_STB1/2 and P94 is SS1.
- P86/P87 are CAN3 (no SCI5), PA7/PB3-PB5 are header/CAM1_PWR/LEDs
  (no SPI2), P95/P96/P66/P67 are PCM/CAM LEDs (no USB2.0 VBUSEN/OVRCUR).
- Default environment boots from SD0 (mmc0 partition 2): import
  boot/uEnv.txt if present, then load OpenCV/Codec binaries, Image and
  boot/rzv2h-rdk-ver101.dtb.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Cong Nguyen <cong.nguyen.zn@renesas.com>
